== Overview ==
The Carrier Astro Toilet is an enemy that was added to the game prior to the [[Episode 75 Update]]. 

== Appearance ==
His Toilet is entirely black with 2 giant cargos on his sides (Like the [[Dual Cargo Toilet]]) which he can deploy [[Interceptor Astro Toilet|Interceptor Astro Toilets]], his reactor core glows yellow as he deploys 3 Lasers below his toilet, he has a helmet.

== Health ==

* 1,181,364,352 HP (Solo/1 Player)
* 2,362,728,704 HP (2 Players)
* 3,544,093,056 HP (3 Players)
* 4,725,457,408 HP (4 Players)
* 5,906,821,760 HP (5 Players)

== Waves ==
This enemy spawns on Wave 160 of [[Endless Mode]].

== Strategy ==
You can fight off this toilet by using [[Ultimate|Ultimates]] such as [[Upgraded Titan Clockman]] or [[Upgraded Titan Drill Man]]. They have high damage and the ability of [[Upgraded Titan Clockman]] does 1 million DPS.
